          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Unlike most of your kind, who dismiss goblins as embarrassments or expendable annoyances, you have studied the methodology behind their irresponsible and incomprehensible actions. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Adopted Ancestry] general feat and must select goblin as the feat's chosen ancestry. You also gain one 1st-level goblin ancestry feat.</p>"
          },
